    "a11y.cvd": "Colour-blind friendly colours", "a11y.cvd.d": "Blue and yellow, with ▲ ▼ ● symbols. Works for all three types.", "a11y.motion": "Less motion", "a11y.motion.d": "Turns animations off.", "a11y.reset": "Reset",
    "lect.up": "At {nombre}, between {rango}, heavy-rain days increased by about {b} days per decade{ic}. The statistical evidence is sufficient ({p}). This describes the past in a ~10 km cell; it does not explain the cause or predict the future.",
    "lect.dn": "At {nombre}, between {rango}, heavy-rain days decreased by about {b} days per decade{ic}. The statistical evidence is sufficient ({p}). This describes the past in a ~10 km cell; it does not explain the cause or predict the future.",
    "lect.nc": "At {nombre}, between {rango}, there is not enough evidence of a change in heavy-rain days (change of {b} days per decade{ic}; {p}). “Inconclusive” does not mean “no change”: it means natural variation prevents us from saying so.",
